From b4d77516d88b5bae21e813f1235bc815f18b45ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 12:23:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: align UI with FreeRTOS BMS USB protocol quirks
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Decode FAULT bit15 (ADBMS ref drift) in FaultBits/EventLog/notes
- Block USB writes to SoC/NV indices 17/48/49 (matches firmware)
- Mark DISCHARGE_OVER_CURRENT as unsigned; catalog NV meta regs
- Simulator: cell 94→20 remap + silent write refuse like firmware
