 BmsUi/Protocol/RegisterCatalog.cs   | 13 ++++---
 BmsUi/Serial/SerialLink.cs          |  4 +--
 BmsUi/Serial/SimulatedTransport.cs  |  3 +-
 README.md                           |  5 +--
 bms_simulator.py                    |  9 ++++-
 11 files changed, 114 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

